      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like this request only because of the added control it provides with what I would consider limited usage scenarios. It certainly wouldnt be used by many but I can see this being a welcome addition depending on exactly what the user can hide. If its a simple avatar on/off it may be useless as one would almost never want to outright hide their own avatar when other users already have that functionality.\nIf it was as or more detailed in choices such as the current safety settings or av3 syncing then there may be some use out of it to control visibility and syncing for sure.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
