      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding onto this, I'd love being able to disable certain avatar things out of curtesy to public users. I like making particle heavy avatars with flashy animations, because my friend group is all okay with it, but in pubs, I'm worried about accidentally being disruptive, so the option to disable large animations is helpful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
