  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-06T06:01:28.931Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I was thinking that implementing something like Reverse Safety Settings would be great for VRC users, and content creators. Sometimes I go into worlds where I don't want everyone to see my avatar. So adding something to safety settings that allows the user to choose what level of user can see their OWN model would be great. Not only would it help with personal ideas but also optimization. Not everyone has to load your model that way + you can just load as a blue loading avatar or the grey vrc robot. I'd love to hear thoughts. This would help me and other friends out in many ways.",
